      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Walpole%2C_New_Hampshire",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The first bridge across the Connecticut River was built in Walpole in 1785, an engineering feat of its day.",
