      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Walpole%2C_New_Hampshire",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The Walpole Historical Society’s museum displays furniture, garments, and records from the town’s 1736 frontier‑fort founding.",
